/P 102 0 R
/E (People return because of three raw human instincts:)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (First: Validation. When a student in Patna faces another delayed exam, or a commuter in Pune sits in traffic paying highway tolls, they want to know: Am I the only one outraged, or does my entire district feel this? You cast one tap, and the true consensus of your neighbors unlocks.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (Second: Cultural Pride. On LokMat, every morning debate gives your district a distinct voice. You don't just vote - you share your region's breakdown card straight to WhatsApp Status to show where your city stands.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
